                     <title type="margin" xml:lang="bo">rgya gar skad du / pra ti mok+Sa sUtra / bod skad du / so so thar pa'i mdo / thams cad mkhyen pa la phyag 'tshal lo / / snyan pa'i ba dan 'jig rten gsum du grags / / dam pa'i chos sgra seng ge'i sgra sgrags pa / / thams cad mkhyen pa dkon mchog mdzod brnyes pa / / zhabs la tshangs dbang gtsug gi nor bus gtugs / /</title>
